<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6496869542362974664..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: America&#39;s Worst Sheriffs, Part I</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>8</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-412063911459489753</id><published>2008-09-02T09:05:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-09-02T09:05:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>During Enoch&#39;s Time 7th from AdamEnoch walked with...</title><content type='html'>During Enoch&#39;s Time 7th from Adam&lt;BR/&gt;Enoch walked with God. Enoch was tranlated and did not see death Genesis 5:24,Hebrews 11:5, Jude 1:14-25. http://www.endtime.org &lt;BR/&gt;Read &quot;The Christian Science Standard Vol. 15, No. 2 and 1 John 2:15. Thou shalt have no other god&#39;s before me Exodus 20:3.Verly, Verly, I say unto you. If a man keep my sayings, he shall never see death John 8:51</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/412063911459489753'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/412063911459489753'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1220367900000#c412063911459489753' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2008 at 9:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2551745376673715838</id><published>2008-08-17T23:15:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-17T23:15:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>U.S. May Ease Police Spy RulesMore Federal Intelli...</title><content type='html'>U.S. May Ease Police Spy Rules&lt;BR/&gt;More Federal Intelligence Changes Planned&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;By Spencer S. Hsu and Carrie Johnson&lt;BR/&gt;Washington Post Staff Writers&lt;BR/&gt;Saturday, August 16, 2008; A01&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The Justice Department has proposed a new domestic spying measure that would make it easier for state and local police to collect intelligence about Americans, share the sensitive data with federal agencies and retain it for at least 10 years.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The proposed changes would revise the federal government&#39;s rules for police intelligence-gathering for the first time since 1993 and would apply to any of the nation&#39;s 18,000 state and local police agencies that receive roughly $1.6 billion each year in federal grants.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;-------&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Nothing to see here folks.  Move along.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/2551745376673715838'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/2551745376673715838'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1219036500000#c2551745376673715838' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2008 at 11:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1264605988897619345</id><published>2008-08-15T21:42:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-15T21:42:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I suppose when people begin to realize that govern...</title><content type='html'>I suppose when people begin to realize that government is the great evil that they need to protect themselves from things might change.  Unfortunately, only briefly as the amerikan experience clearly shows.  Of course  you&#39;d have to recognize also that gov&#39;ts hand-maiden theism as a willing accomplice which isn&#39;t likely amongst the sheeple either.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Better to have people suffer the biases of others than to enjoy the benefits of personal liberty and freedom.  Isn&#39;t that what the ism&#39;s/ist&#39;s have always been about?  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;After all, one would think that even a true theist would at least recognize that it is not for man to make one of their god&#39;s created plants illegal.  Then again, those are usually the first people to demand that &#39;those people&#39; be put in their place aren&#39;t they.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/1264605988897619345'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/1264605988897619345'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1218858120000#c1264605988897619345' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2008 at 9:42 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7457008935777665910</id><published>2008-08-15T17:44:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-15T17:44:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Re: ZacharyYes sir, you are correct! (delivered in...</title><content type='html'>Re: Zachary&lt;BR/&gt;Yes sir, you are correct! (delivered in a McMahonesque baritone)&lt;BR/&gt;I recall not too long ago that a CIA registered plane full of cocaine had crashed in southern Mexico, and I vaguely remember reading about another story of CIA compilicity in ferrying in some major drug shipments into Miami. Moreover, retired and highly decorated DEA agent Michael Levine has some pretty interesting information on this topic as well, most noteworthy of which included a conversation he had with CIA operatives at an inter agency party in Buenos Aires back in 1979 concerning insidious CIA black ops.  Perhaps my friend Will Grigg will revisit some of these stories or related stories some time in the future? &lt;BR/&gt;-Gilligan W.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/7457008935777665910'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/7457008935777665910'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1218843840000#c7457008935777665910' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2008 at 5:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6637498613282553002</id><published>2008-08-15T12:20:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-15T12:20:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Saw this on the web today. Denver cops are readyin...</title><content type='html'>Saw this on the web today. Denver cops are readying cages for the mass arrests. This should make for some interesting police stories.&lt;BR/&gt;http://cbs4denver.com/denver2008/denver.protesters.arrested.2.793930.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/6637498613282553002'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/6637498613282553002'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1218824400000#c6637498613282553002' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2008 at 12:20 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-734422743821182922</id><published>2008-08-15T11:32:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-15T11:32:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Again, the only thing that cansave us from these a...</title><content type='html'>Again, the only thing that can&lt;BR/&gt;save us from these a-holes is a&lt;BR/&gt;jury that knows the difference&lt;BR/&gt;between liberty and bondage.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Obviously the &quot;law&quot; can&#39;t(and won&#39;t)&lt;BR/&gt;save us.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Where the Spirit of the Lord is,&lt;BR/&gt;there is Liberty.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;-St.Paul&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Come soon, Lord!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/734422743821182922'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/734422743821182922'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1218821520000#c734422743821182922' title=''/><author><name>Will Blalock</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2008 at 11:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5199986890670941969</id><published>2008-08-14T21:28:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-14T21:28:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article Will! If only there were more sherif...</title><content type='html'>Great article Will! If only there were more sheriffs like Dave &quot;Ned Flanders&quot; Mattis. Too bad he isn&#39;t pictured clad in &quot;Riders of the Rohan&quot; armor. Until now I had mistakenly assumed that only those who were hopelessly corrupt and slavishly obedient to &quot;higher&quot; federal authority ever got elected sheriff.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/5199986890670941969'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/5199986890670941969'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1218770880000#c5199986890670941969' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 14, 2008 at 9:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5756410761059390220</id><published>2008-08-14T17:02:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-14T17:02:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>A self-inflicted wound indeed, Mr. Grigg. On at le...</title><content type='html'>A self-inflicted wound indeed, Mr. Grigg. On at least a few occasions that are provable, the Feds have brought narcotics into the country.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/5756410761059390220'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6496869542362974664/comments/default/5756410761059390220'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html?showComment=1218754920000#c5756410761059390220' title=''/><author><name>Zachary</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05334525584242029389</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/americas-worst-sheriffs-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6496869542362974664' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6496869542362974664' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-995279443"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 14, 2008 at 5:02 PM"/></entry></feed>